1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:15,888
In Authentik Directory -> Users, create demo.operator with an email address and assign oscar-operators.

2
00:00:15,928 --> 00:00:26,068
Open the user Overview tab and click Create recovery link to generate a single-use 1-tap SSO Passkey enrollment URL.

3
00:00:26,108 --> 00:00:38,738
Delete demo.operator in Authentik to trigger oscar-hub-sync Zero-Trust revocation, then confirm clean Users & Roles (/users) on OSCAR.
